{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54339","headline":"和王员外雪晴早朝 · 钱珝","name":"和王员外雪晴早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫微晴雪带恩光，绕仗偏随鸳鹭行。\n长信月留宁避晓，宜春花满不飞香。\n独看积素凝清禁，已觉轻寒让太阳。\n题柱盛名兼绝唱，风流谁继汉田郎。\n（见《钱考功集》卷八）（按：《万首唐人绝句》卷六八收前四句作钱珝诗。\n《韵语阳秋》卷二谓此诗及《同程七蚤入中书》「二诗皆珝所作无疑，盖起未尝入中书也。\n」《全唐诗》卷二三九收此诗於钱起名下，今爲移正。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱珝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}